dist/
# The example's working directory: only these files of .presmium/ belong to a document (recordings,
# drawings, assets, synthesized speech and the locks); the rest there is generated.
**/.presmium/*
!**/.presmium/freeze/
!**/.presmium/anchors.lock.json
!**/.presmium/drawings/
!**/.presmium/assets/
!**/.presmium/speech/
!**/.presmium/speech.lock.json
